                                "text": "(By its interwoven mascles his hanberk^([sic]) is conspicuously marked.) This was called \"rustred armour,\" as contrasted with \"ringed armour,\" one row of flat rings, about double the usual size, being laid over the other so that two in the upper partially covered one below."
